      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Production read-only toner intelligence\nThe primary question is: **Which toner should we ship today?**\n\n**Hard safety rule:** no fresh KFS telemetry = no Ship Today/Ship Soon recommendation. Missing device or toner reporting is forced to **Needs Review**. This dashboard is observational only and creates no Autotask orders or tickets. Customer/device seasonality remains disabled until sufficient history exists.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "AOT Toner Readiness",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "jason-prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0
        },
